Subject: [PATCH 090/119] qca-nss-clients-add-l2tp-support

Imported from https://github.com/qosmio/openwrt-ipq.git target/linux/qualcommax/patches-6.12/0603-2-qca-nss-clients-add-l2tp-support.patch (added in 2f34da0af7); the patch file carries no author or description.
[Andrei: Ported to 7.2: the lockless __ppp_is_multilink()/__ppp_hold_channels() hunks are dropped, PPPoE offload (0961) already adds them; the channel-ops hunk applies to the 7.2 pppol2tp_connect() context.]
